<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>Northstar Cloud</title>
  <style>
    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;
      color: #f8fbff;
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at 80% 0%, rgba(85,171,255,0.35), transparent 28%),
        linear-gradient(180deg, #12233b 0%, #0a111c 100%);
    }
    .wrap {
      max-width: 1100px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 80px 24px;
    }
    h1 { font-size: clamp(40px, 8vw, 90px); margin: 0 0 18px; }
    p { max-width: 580px; line-height: 1.7; color: rgba(248,251,255,0.78); }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="wrap">
    <h1>Northstar Cloud</h1>
    <p>Distributed edge hosting with practical observability, private ingress shaping and fast regional rollouts.</p>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
